  "input": "When can search-indexer be deployed?\n[2025-10-16] incident-review/INC-2025-023: Review of INC-2025-023 (search-indexer, 2025-10-13). The root cause was a reindex job that failed silently on a full disk. We decided that reindex jobs will page on failure, because a silent reindex failure left stale results for two days in INC-2025-023. [2025-08-27] standup/cinder/2025-08-27: The search indexer is pinned to OpenSearch 2.11; the pin lifts when the full reindex completes. Cinder sits on the third floor. [2025-12-17] standup/dune/2025-12-17: Decided in today's standup: search-indexer will rebuild the index nightly instead of on every catalog write, since incremental updates left stale entries behind after failed writes.",
